---
// HowWeWork section
---
<section id="approach" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 128px 24px">
<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 18%, #000 82%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 18%, #000 82%, transparent 100%);">
<defs><filter id="soft" x="-50%" y="-50%" width="200%" height="200%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="90"></feGaussianBlur></filter></defs>
<g filter="url(#soft)"><ellipse cx="1150" cy="300" rx="420" ry="260" fill="#24418F" fill-opacity="0.45"></ellipse><ellipse cx="300" cy="700" rx="460" ry="240" fill="#5B8CFF" fill-opacity="0.22"></ellipse><ellipse cx="780" cy="520" rx="300" ry="200" fill="#2B4C9B" fill-opacity="0.25"></ellipse></g>
</svg>
<div style="position: relative; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 720px">
<div style="font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #5B8CFF; font-weight: 700">HOW WE WORK</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 54px); line-height: 1.1; color: #F4EEE2; letter-spacing: -0.01em">From your data to measurable AI value.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #BDB5A6">Four steps, each ending in something you can see, use and keep.</p>
</div>
<a href="/#contact" style="background: #5B8CFF; color: #0B1020; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; padding: 14px 22px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px">Start with an assessment</a>
</div>
<ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr)); gap: 20px">
<li style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; backdrop-filter: blur(12px)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5B8CFF"></span>STEP 01</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2">Assess</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #BDB5A6">Find where your data can create AI value — and what is holding it back.</span></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; color: #0F172A; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 250px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700">Readiness scorecard</span><span style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #2F5BD3; background: #EAF0FF; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px">ASSESS</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #475569"><span>Data quality</span><span style="font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A">62%</span></div><div style="height: 6px; background: #EEF2F6; border-radius: 3px"><div style="width: 62%; height: 6px; background: #2F5BD3; border-radius: 3px"></div></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #475569"><span>Governance</span><span style="font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A">45%</span></div><div style="height: 6px; background: #EEF2F6; border-radius: 3px"><div style="width: 45%; height: 6px; background: #E9B872; border-radius: 3px"></div></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #475569"><span>Platform</span><span style="font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A">70%</span></div><div style="height: 6px; background: #EEF2F6; border-radius: 3px"><div style="width: 70%; height: 6px; background: #2F5BD3; border-radius: 3px"></div></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #475569"><span>AI readiness</span><span style="font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A">38%</span></div><div style="height: 6px; background: #EEF2F6; border-radius: 3px"><div style="width: 38%; height: 6px; background: #E9B872; border-radius: 3px"></div></div></div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748B; border-top: 1px solid #EEF2F6; padding-top: 10px">Top 3 value opportunities ranked →</div>
</div>
</li>
<li style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; backdrop-filter: blur(12px)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5B8CFF"></span>STEP 02</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2">Design</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #BDB5A6">A target architecture and roadmap built around your highest-value use cases.</span></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; color: #0F172A; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 250px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700">Target architecture</span><span style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #2F5BD3; background: #EAF0FF; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px">DESIGN</span></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px"><div style="border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 7px 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; color: #475569">EHR</div><div style="border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 7px 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; color: #475569">Claims</div><div style="border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 7px 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; color: #475569">ERP</div></div><div style="text-align: center; color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1">↓</div><div style="background: #0F172A; color: #F4EEE2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; justify-content: space-between"><span>Governed platform</span><span style="font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.8">access · lineage · cost</span></div><div style="text-align: center; color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1">↓</div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px"><div style="background: #EAF0FF; color: #2F5BD3; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; justify-content: space-between"><span>Analytics</span><span style="font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.8"></span></div><div style="background: #EAF0FF; color: #2F5BD3; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; justify-content: space-between"><span>AI & agents</span><span style="font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.8"></span></div></div>
</div>
