<li style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; backdrop-filter: blur(12px)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5B8CFF"></span>STEP 03</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2">Build</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #BDB5A6">Governed platform and first use cases delivered to production.</span></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; color: #0F172A; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 250px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700">Use case: production readiness</span><span style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #2F5BD3; background: #EAF0FF; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px">BUILD</span></div><div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2F5BD3; color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none">✓</span><span>Access policies enforced</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2F5BD3; color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none">✓</span><span>Lineage captured</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2F5BD3; color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none">✓</span><span>Cost tags applied</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2F5BD3; color: #F4EEE2; font-size: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none">✓</span><span>Model monitoring live</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9"><span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #CBD5E1; box-sizing: border-box; flex: none"></span><span>Business sign-off</span></div></div>
</div>
</li>
<li style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; backdrop-filter: blur(12px)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5B8CFF"></span>STEP 04</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #F4EEE2">Enable</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #BDB5A6">Your teams own it, adopt it and track the value it creates.</span></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; color: #0F172A; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-height: 250px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700">Value tracker</span><span style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #2F5BD3; background: #EAF0FF; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px">ENABLE</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px"><span style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748B">Use cases in production</span><span style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700">Growing</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 200 60" style="width: 100%; height: 70px" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 52 L30 48 L60 44 L90 36 L120 30 L150 20 L200 8" fill="none" stroke="#2F5BD3" stroke-width="2.5"></path><path d="M0 52 L30 48 L60 44 L90 36 L120 30 L150 20 L200 8 L200 60 L0 60 Z" fill="#2F5BD3" fill-opacity="0.08"></path></svg><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; color: #475569"><div style="background: #F5F7FA; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px">Adoption by team</div><div style="background: #F5F7FA; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px">Cost per use case</div></div>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
<div style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748B">Illustrative sample deliverables.</div>
</div>
</section>
